WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Xiao Zhang, are you married?

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,000
I'm only 22 years old. I don't even have a girlfriend. I'm talking about getting married.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
He is indeed young and promising.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Beauty Fan, I’ve known you for so long, but I still don’t know your occupation.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
I work at our Fan family's Changkang Pharmaceutical Company

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
My dad is the general manager and I am the vice president

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,320
Changkang Pharmaceutical? Changkang Pharmaceutical is worth nearly 100 billion

8
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:23,320
The Fan family is at least a wealthy family with a net worth of tens of billions.

9
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,320
If you say I don’t have Baoxing, I will definitely be envious

10
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:29,320
But now, I alone belong to a wealthy family, and it is the top wealthy family.

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,320
You are younger than me, right? Just serve as the vice president of a listed company.

12
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,320
It really makes people speak Chinese

13
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,320
My daughter is a famous and talented girl

14
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,320
Graduated from Huaqing University at the age of 19

15
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:43,320
Now I am 20 years old. I have been working for a year. Being a vice president depends entirely on my ability.

16
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:46,320
Miss Fan has the best of both worlds, she is the top Bai Fumei

17
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,320
He must have a boyfriend

18
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:51,320
No, no, pursuing my daughter’s hero is like crossing a river

19
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,320
But I haven’t liked it yet
